        "original_id": "d97419ed-5d02-50d8-a7d8-b47f5f991b14",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Homer Simpson, Principal Skinner, Selma, Patty, Hans Moleman, Harry Shearer, Matt Groening, Dan Castellaneta\n- Works: \"Principal Charming\", \"The Simpsons\"\n- Characters: Principal W. Seymour Skinner, Hans Moleman\n\nFacts:\n- In the episode \"Principal Charming,\" Homer Simpson invites Principal Skinner to dinner, but Principal Skinner instead falls for Patty, who is Selma's twin sister.\n- Principal W. Seymour Skinner is a fictional character in the American animated sitcom \"The Simpsons.\"\n- Principal W. Seymour Skinner was born Armin Tamzarian.\n- Harry Shearer voices Principal W. Seymour Skinner.\n- Hans Moleman first appeared in the episode \"Principal Charming.\"\n- Matt Groening created Hans Moleman.\n- Dan Castellaneta voices Hans Moleman.",
